# criterion-foreign-qualified: a library-qualified criterion ref must produce criterion-misuse, not "no concept named X".
library "Root".
include "Lib".

activity "Approve":
- request CPGCommunicationRequest.
- with `ok`.
activity "Deny":
- request CPGCommunicationRequest.
- with `no`.

decision "D":
first:
- when "Lib"."Eligible" then recommend activity "Approve".
- otherwise then recommend activity "Deny".
